(text "POWER\nUSB-C 5V (VBUS) and 12V barrel jack. 12V -> TPS54202 buck -> +5V_DRV.\nTPS2116 priority mux: +5V_DRV preferred (PR1 threshold ~4.3V), VBUS fallback -> +5V.\n+5V feeds floppy drive power (J3) and AP7361C 3.3V LDO.\n+12V only present with barrel jack (needed for 5.25in drives)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d6081d08-74c1-4afc-9bbd-a25225866700"))
